                    Coin Change Pattern ("dfs inside For Loop")
1. Be comfortable to call recursive dfs() inside the For Loop.
2. Be comfortable to use local variable initialized just before the For Loop, 
   use it to collect the results of your interest and return it just after the For Loop.
3. Don't over complicate it, just light drawing to understand the flow pattern, then just TRUST
   your function fully and keep going forward.

Note : Don't forget your Base Case(s), and Memoization of your results.

Note: Most "incl vs nincl" could be generalized and written using Coin Change Pattern.

Note: Coin Change Pattern maybe optimized via Bottom Up DP. Ex. # 518